Subject: Serialize SoundWire bulk transfers without recursive I/O locking

Keep command ID assignment and transfer under one mutex, preserve
controller-internal serialization, and return platform transfer errors.
The existing hardware CMD Ignored interrupt remains unchanged.

---

--- a/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/soc/swr-mstr-ctrl.c
+++ b/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/soc/swr-mstr-ctrl.c
